B.Hn=s(["You don't have to feel ready to begin. A small first step may help you feel more ready.","Small steps still move you forward.","A hard day is a day, not a verdict on you.","Rest is part of the work, not a break from it.","You are allowed to go slowly.","Noticing how you feel is already a kind of care.","Feelings can come in waves. This one may shift, even if only a little.","Be as kind to yourself today as you would be to a friend.","You have got through every difficult day so far.","Progress is rarely a straight line. Wobbles count.","One breath at a time is enough.","You don't have to fix everything today.","Asking for help is a strength you can use.","Your worth isn't measured by how much you get done.","Today only needs today's effort.","It's okay to feel more than one thing at once.","Gentle is still strong.","You can pause without giving up.","Some days, showing up is the achievement.","Let this moment be just this moment.","What you feel makes sense, even when it's hard to explain.","You are more than your worst thoughts.","Tiny kindnesses to yourself add up.","If it feels comfortable, try a gentle breath out. Or notice something you can see around you.","There is no right way to feel this morning.","Even slow growth is growth.","You can start again at any point in the day.","Being honest about a bad day is brave.","Your mind deserves the patience you give others.","Calm isn't something you have to earn.","Look for one small good thing today. It may be very small.","You are allowed to take up space.","Healing has its own timetable.","Your worries may not tell the whole story.","If it feels okay, let your jaw and shoulders soften a little. Or just notice where you are right now.","It's okay to do less on the days you have less.","A thought is not a fact.","You don't need to see the whole path to take the next step.","Kindness counts, especially the kind you give yourself.","This is a moment to notice, not to judge.","Feelings can change over time. You don't have to face this one alone.","Courage can be quiet.","If it helps, choose one thing to focus on, while making space for anything urgent.","You are not alone in this, even when it feels that way.","Every check-in is a small act of looking after yourself.","There is room for both struggle and hope.","You can be a work in progress and still be enough.","If it feels comfortable, settle into this breath. Or let your eyes rest on something nearby.","This rough moment won't be the whole story.","What helped a little before might help a little again.","You're allowed to set something down for a while.","Steady doesn't mean perfect. You can pause, seek support, and begin again.","Take the next hour one step at a time. Reach out if you need support.","If you'd like, let your breathing slow a little. Or simply let this moment be as it is.","Hope can be small and still be real.","You matter on the good days and the hard ones.","If it helps, notice your feet on the ground. Or look around and name one thing you can see.","Today can be simple.","If patience feels hard to find, it's okay to take a pause.","Being here, and paying attention, is a good start."],t.s)
